# Binary CAD / Office formats that appear only in reference-design-examples/.
# Each needs its own line: gitattribute matching is case-sensitive on Linux
# (core.ignorecase=false), so *.dxf above does NOT match the 28 uppercase
# .DXF drawings in that tree, and a pointer checked out on a case-sensitive
# filesystem would be written as literal text. Both cases are listed.
*.bak filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.doc filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.xlsm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.vdml filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
